recommend keep-going the three read-stack floors are green and the decoder now names the keys; the next rung is the small binding that joins them -- a pure map from a dexter_key navigation Key to a scooter_read paging verb (nav_up->line_up, nav_down->line_down, page_up->page_up, page_down->page_down), so a byte run scrolls a held view and render_window draws each step, still no TTY and no network; the raw TTY read (cbreak) and the Comlink wire between two Constel piers reach the serve gate, the maintainer's hand
